s/Lifecycle Guard | Archive → `archivedAt` + `DISABLED`, excluded from pickers app-wide, history retained. Affects every picker/query that lists users (incl. FR-28's directory picker). |\n| FR-14 | Status/Lifecycle Guard | Self-disable/self-archive block + \"last active admin\" invariant. A service-layer guard checked on every disable/archive mutation, not just the UI. |\n| FR-15 | Family Linking | Parent-student links manageable from student form, parent form, or student detail \"Family\" card — one link-management service, three entry points. |\n| FR-16 | Family Linking | Max 4 parents/student; exactly one `isPrimary` link (set-one-clears-others) — a data-integrity invariant enforced in the link service/transaction, not the UI. |\n| FR-17 | Access Control Helper | `getAccessibleStudentIds(user)` + `assertCanViewStudent(user, studentId)` in `src/server/auth/student-access.ts`. Shared authorization chokepoint every student-scoped read (FR-11, FR-24, FR-25, FR-26) must route through; returns `[]` for TEACHER pending PRD-05. |\n| FR-18 | CSV Import Pipeline | Downloadable CSV templates (students/teachers) — static asset/route, defines the column contract FR-19/FR-20 parse against. |\n| FR-19 | CSV Import Pipeline | Client-side parse (papaparse) into a preview DataGrid with per-row/per-cell validation status — browser-only, no server round-trip yet. |\n| FR-20 | CSV Import Pipeline | `POST /api/users/import`, batches of 200, server re-validates, one transaction per batch, per-row results. The real import boundary — ties to NFR-3 (all-or-nothing batches) and reuses FR-10's validators server-side. |\n| FR-21 | CSV Import Pipeline | Import options (invite toggle, case-insensitive grade-level match, strict date format) — parsing/matching rules inside the FR-20 service. |\n| FR-22 | CSV Import Pipeline | Post-import summary + \"Download error report\" CSV — a response-shaping concern on top of FR-20's per-row results. |\n| FR-23 | CSV Import Pipeline | Idempotent re-import: