s (academic years, subjects, rooms, grade levels, users). Architect should decide: add a lightweight `group` field to NavItem, or ship Sections/Courses as flat entries for now.\",\n    \"NFR-7 (MEDIUM confidence): src/server/auth/permissions.ts and requireUser() described in Platform Context do not exist yet — only requireRole.ts and student-access.ts are present. Same brownfield gap PRD-04's architect handoff flagged; new routes should keep using the requireRole(...ALL_ROLES) stand-in until PRD-01 lands.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}\n","numLines":16,"startLine":1,"totalLines":16}}}
