{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjDHKyc5cBrtvo5aUivF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've written `artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md` for SH-6 (the arch-research-reqs task). It maps each of the 61 requirements to the architectural concern it implies, and only cites IDs that exist (FR-1–45, NFR-1–16).\n\nI checked intake's codebase claims against the repo and added a few facts for the system-design step:\n- **Serializable transactions have no retry yet.** `academicYears.ts` and `terms.ts` already run serializable transactions, but nothing retries when one fails on a conflict. NFR-1 (two conflicting inserts → exactly one succeeds) needs a small new retry helper.\n- **Subject colour already exists.** `Subject.color` is in the schema, so the timetable grid needs no schema change for cell colours.\n- **The parent child picker can reuse an existing endpoint.** `/api/me/children` already exists, and `Room` already links back to its sections.\n- **The clash checks share one function.** They run inside the slot-saving transaction, and the \"where would this clash?\" map loaded at drag start runs them in batch. That batch needs about 4 queries in total, not one per cell, to meet the 300 ms target.\n\nThe notes list 6 design choices for the system-design step to make, each with my recommendation. The main ones:\n- **Free rooms:** add one admin-only free-rooms endpoint.\n- **Room check while dragging:** skip it; the room is still checked when the course is dropped.\n- **Switching off a teaching day:** count and delete that day's slots across all academic years, not just the current one.\n\nEvery blocker intake reported is addressed in the notes.\n\nThe other files in `artifacts/architect/` and `artifacts/dev-planning/` are still from ticket SH-4. I didn't touch them because they belong to the other sub-tasks, which overwrite them, and I flagged this in the notes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":814,"cache_read_input_tokens":56160,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":814},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"24f05be5-3d50-40f4-9d3a-c65b90598d64","uuid":"e97bfa12-86d0-4e4d-a3ea-cd0c81f87612","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:16:00.111Z","request_id":"req_011CgjDHKmxaW1go2QyQdsym"}
