{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FZCHosr9NEPNCaVoqJU1h7","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-06T05:29:02Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"requirementsCount\": 51,\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 94,\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"GREENFIELD within brownfield: there is no attendance code yet. Design the models and migration (raw SQL CHECK plus two partial unique indexes), src/server/attendance/attendance-service.ts, src/lib/validators/attendance.ts, the 10 API routes, the /attendance/take pages, the student and course Attendance tabs, /admin/attendance, the nav entries, the seed data and the tests.\",\n    \"REUSE: getScheduleForDate (timetable-service), notifyStudentAndParents/notify, assertCanManageCourse/assertCanViewStudent, audit(), toCsv(), getSchoolSettings/updateSchoolSettings, and the components in src/components/<Name>/ (DataTable, StatCard, UserAvatar, PageHeader, Toast/useToast). These are not in src/components/shared/.\",\n    \"FR-5 (MEDIUM): there is no school settings page and src/app/api/settings/school/ is empty. Default: add a minimal admin attendance-settings UI and PATCH route built on updateSchoolSettings().\",\n    \"FR-16 (LOW): the daily register route is unspecified. Default: /attendance/take/section/[sectionId]?date=, reusing the course register component.\",\n    \"FR-23 (LOW): metadata for attendance.corrected and attendance.register_missing is unspecified. Default: ATTENDANCE category, email false; recipients are PARENT+STUDENT and TEACHER respectively.\",\n    \"NFR-6: Dev must reach the mui-mcp server (useMuiDocs/fetchDocs for 9.5.0) before writing UI. If it is unreachable, that is a hard blocker per the PRD.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}\n# Requirements Analysis Notes — ticket SH-1\n\nWritten by `arch-research-reqs` for `arch-design-system`. This is a supporting document, not a primary phase output.\nSource: `artifacts/intake/requirements.json` (re-run 2026-11-05T16:26:09Z) for PRD-01 Authentication, Sessions & RBAC (SCH-001).\nIt has 34 FRs and 15 NFRs (49 requirements) at 97% confidence. `handoff-to-architect.json` lists 5 blockers.\nRun mode: `--brownfield --tech-stack react`.\n\n> This file replaces an earlier SH-1 notes file. That version listed `/login`, the seed users and the role/status\n> migration as new work. All three are now **present** on disk.\n\n**Headline:** this is a **UI-gap + tests** ticket. The backend, every API route, `/login`, the seed and the\nmigration already exist. The design adds **4 pages**, rewires the **shell**, and adds **tests**.\n**No new endpoint, service, model or migration is needed.** `arch-api-contracts` documents the 5 existing routes as they are.\n\nConcern buckets: **Data Model**, **Auth Core**, **Service**, **API (existing)**, **UI: Auth Pages**,\ntotal 136\ndrwxr-xr-x   8 ikramaansari  staff    256 Nov  5 21:30 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  11 ikramaansari  staff    352 Nov  5 11:37 ..\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  15692 Nov  5 21:31 api-contracts.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff   1506 Nov  5 21:31 handoff-to-dev-planning.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  11982 Nov  5 21:28 requirements-analysis-notes.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  17451 Nov  5 21:30 system-design.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  10155 Nov  5 21:27 tech-stack-decisions.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff    374 Nov  5 21:31 threat-model-notes.json","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"69c9af49-395f-43b5-8c02-c9a3647dc0ab","uuid":"5548a728-6893-4ecf-b1be-3f67ad7789f2","timestamp":"2026-11-06T05:30:58.865Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-06T05:29:02Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"requirementsCount\": 51,\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 94,\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"GREENFIELD within brownfield: there is no attendance code yet. Design the models and migration (raw SQL CHECK plus two partial unique indexes), src/server/attendance/attendance-service.ts, src/lib/validators/attendance.ts, the 10 API routes, the /attendance/take pages, the student and course Attendance tabs, /admin/attendance, the nav entries, the seed data and the tests.\",\n    \"REUSE: getScheduleForDate (timetable-service), notifyStudentAndParents/notify, assertCanManageCourse/assertCanViewStudent, audit(), toCsv(), getSchoolSettings/updateSchoolSettings, and the components in src/components/<Name>/ (DataTable, StatCard, UserAvatar, PageHeader, Toast/useToast). These are not in src/components/shared/.\",\n    \"FR-5 (MEDIUM): there is no school settings page and src/app/api/settings/school/ is empty. Default: add a minimal admin attendance-settings UI and PATCH route built on updateSchoolSettings().\",\n    \"FR-16 (LOW): the daily register route is unspecified. Default: /attendance/take/section/[sectionId]?date=, reusing the course register component.\",\n    \"FR-23 (LOW): metadata for attendance.corrected and attendance.register_missing is unspecified. Default: ATTENDANCE category, email false; recipients are PARENT+STUDENT and TEACHER respectively.\",\n    \"NFR-6: Dev must reach the mui-mcp server (useMuiDocs/fetchDocs for 9.5.0) before writing UI. If it is unreachable, that is a hard blocker per the PRD.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"architect\"\n}\n# Requirements Analysis Notes — ticket SH-1\n\nWritten by `arch-research-reqs` for `arch-design-system`. This is a supporting document, not a primary phase output.\nSource: `artifacts/intake/requirements.json` (re-run 2026-11-05T16:26:09Z) for PRD-01 Authentication, Sessions & RBAC (SCH-001).\nIt has 34 FRs and 15 NFRs (49 requirements) at 97% confidence. `handoff-to-architect.json` lists 5 blockers.\nRun mode: `--brownfield --tech-stack react`.\n\n> This file replaces an earlier SH-1 notes file. That version listed `/login`, the seed users and the role/status\n> migration as new work. All three are now **present** on disk.\n\n**Headline:** this is a **UI-gap + tests** ticket. The backend, every API route, `/login`, the seed and the\nmigration already exist. The design adds **4 pages**, rewires the **shell**, and adds **tests**.\n**No new endpoint, service, model or migration is needed.** `arch-api-contracts` documents the 5 existing routes as they are.\n\nConcern buckets: **Data Model**, **Auth Core**, **Service**, **API (existing)**, **UI: Auth Pages**,\ntotal 136\ndrwxr-xr-x   8 ikramaansari  staff    256 Nov  5 21:30 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  11 ikramaansari  staff    352 Nov  5 11:37 ..\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  15692 Nov  5 21:31 api-contracts.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff   1506 Nov  5 21:31 handoff-to-dev-planning.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  11982 Nov  5 21:28 requirements-analysis-notes.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  17451 Nov  5 21:30 system-design.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  10155 Nov  5 21:27 tech-stack-decisions.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff    374 Nov  5 21:31 threat-model-notes.json","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01FZCHosr9NEPNCaVoqJU1h7","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
