eRole.ts.\",\n    \"REUSE: rateLimit(key, limit, windowMs) in src/server/rate-limit.ts (a per-process sliding window) for the 60 uploads/hour limit. audit() comes from src/server/audit.ts, notify() from src/server/notifications/notify.ts, and the type keys live in NOTIFICATION_TYPES in src/server/notifications/types.ts.\",\n    \"REUSE: the course tab registry src/config/course-tabs.ts (currently overview, roster and attendance) and the student tab registry src/config/student-tabs.ts (currently courses and attendance). The 'Content' and 'Learning' tabs are added there.\",\n    \"DAILY MAINTENANCE HOOK: PRD-04's 'daily maintenance run' is the once-per-day purgeOldNotifications() call inside src/app/api/internal/email/dispatch/route.ts, which is gated by an in-memory lastPurgeAt. purgeOrphanFiles() should be called next to it.\",\n    \"LOGO: SchoolSettings.logoUrl (String?) is in prisma/schema.prisma:195 and in UpdateSchoolSettingsInput (src/server/services/settings.ts), the email BaseLayout and render.ts use it, and PATCH /api/settings/school exists. However, there is NO /admin/settings/school page in src/app/(app)/admin/, so FR-9's 'replace the logo URL field' has no field to replace.\",\n    \"SHARED COMPONENTS: they live in src/components/<Name>/ (DataTable, ConfirmDialog, EmptyState, FormField, PageHeader, Toast/useToast, UserPicker...), not in src/components/shared/. New shared components (FileUpload, FileList, MarkdownView) should follow the existing src/components/<Name>/ layout.\",\n    \"No .gitignore was found at the workspace root. UPLOAD_DIR (./uploads) must be git-ignored, so either create one or add the entry if a .gitignore exists elsewhere.\",\n    \"VERIFIED: assertCanViewCourse already allows PARENT when a linked student has an ACTIVE enrollment, and STUDENT only when ACTIVE-enrolled. Use it unchanged.\"\n  ],\n  \"functionalRequirements\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-1\",\n      \"description\": \"Add the FileObject Prisma model (ownerId→User, originalName, mimeType, sizeBytes, unique storageKey '<yyyy>/<mm>/<cuid>.<ext>', sha256, context, nullable contextId, createdAt, index on [context, contextId]) with a migration.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"FR-1 File storage (Prisma block)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-2\",\n      \"description\": \"Create src/server/storage.ts exposing saveFile(stream, meta), readFile(storageKey) and deleteFile(storageKey). It writes under UPLOAD_DIR (new env var, default ./uploads, git-ignored) and never inside public/.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"FR-1.1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-3\",\n      \"description\": \"POST /api/files (multipart, any signed-in user) accepts one file plus context and creates a FileObject with contextId null.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"FR-1.2; API table\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-4\",\n      \"description\": \"Enforce a per-file size limit of MAX_UPLOAD_MB (env, default 25). Oversize uploads are rejected with VALIDATION_ERROR 'File exceeds 25 MB.'\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"FR-1.2\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-5\",\n      \"description\": \"Allow only pdf, doc, docx, xls, xlsx, ppt, pptx, txt, csv, png, jpg, jpeg, gif, webp, mp3, mp4 and zip, validated by extension AND by magic-number sniffing with the file-type package. Anything else is rejected with VALIDATION_ERROR 'File type .<ext> is not allowed.'\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"FR-1.2; Acceptance Criterion 4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-6\",\n      \"description\": \"Text formats with no magic number (txt, csv) and Office OOXML formats that sniff as zip (docx/xlsx/pptx) are accepted when the sniffed type is absent or consistent with the extension. Executable or mismatched signatures are rejected.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"source\": \"FR-1.2 (inferred: file-type cannot detect txt/csv; OOXML sniffs as zip container)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-7\",\n      \"description\": \"Sanitise filenames: strip path separators and control characters and cap the length at 150 characters, then store the result as originalName.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"FR-1.3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-8\",\n      \"description\": \"GET /api/files/:id streams the file with the stored MIME type, X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff, and Content-Disposition: attachment. It uses inline for images and PDFs only when ?inline=1.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"FR-1.4; API table\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-9\",\n      \"description\": \"Add a file access resolver registry src/server/files/access.ts with registerFileAccess(context, (user, file) => boolean | Promise<boolean>). An unknown context allows only the owner and ADMIN. Denied requests return 404/403 without streaming any bytes.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"FR-1.4; Acceptance Criterion 3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-10\",\n      \"description\": \"Register the 'lesson' file context (allowed when the user can view the lesson under the visibility rules) and the 'logo' context (public, including unauthenticated users).\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"FR-1.4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-11\",\n      \"description\": \"DELETE /api/files/:id is allowed for the owner or ADMIN, only while the file is unattached (contextId null). It removes both the row and the stored bytes.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"API table\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-12\",\n      \"description\": \"purgeOrphanFiles() deletes FileObjects with contextId null that are older than 24 hours, together with their stored bytes. It is called from PRD-04's daily maintenance run.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"source\": \"FR-1.5\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FR-13\",\n      \"description\": \"A