{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnB9cTMtq4yhfS5CHnS2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've written `artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md` for SH-8. It maps all 48 FRs and 12 NFRs to the architectural concern each one implies. Every ID cited is in `requirements.json`, and I changed no other files.\n\nTwo places where the requirements as written won't work:\n\n- **Signed-out users can't load the logo.** The middleware returns 401 for every `/api/*` path except `/api/health`, `/api/auth/` and `/api/internal/`. The logo is meant to be public (FR-10), so as things stand it won't load on the login page or in emails. My recommendation is to add `/api/files/` to the public paths list in `src/config/public-routes.ts`. Then uploading and deleting files must check the user is signed in themselves, because the middleware would no longer do it.\n- **Some files would be deleted after 24 hours.** The daily cleanup (FR-12) removes any file not attached to a record. Two kinds of file would never get attached as currently specified:\n  - the logo, because only its URL is saved in the settings;\n  - images inserted into lesson text, because they aren't saved as lesson attachments.\n\n  The design needs to attach both when the settings or lesson is saved.\n\nThe notes list five other open decisions for `arch-design-system`:\n- how to parse uploads without buffering whole files, given no multipart library is allowed;\n- what happens to a file when it's removed from a lesson;\n- what triggers an audit log entry on admin edits;\n- how to validate SVG logos;\n- that email templates need to turn the relative logo URL into a full one.\n\nThe other files in `artifacts/architect/` are still left over from SH-7, and the next sub-tasks need to overwrite them. I also confirmed there's no root `.gitignore`, so one needs creating to keep `uploads/` out of git."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7453,"cache_read_input_tokens":43603,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7453},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"602dd78b-ddb5-4a5b-87b4-9966477239d5","uuid":"a650d6e3-384e-4788-82da-4c9985817854","timestamp":"2026-11-06T18:49:49.171Z","request_id":"req_011CgnB9c3Ymz3iTHr4vdcaF"}
