d and STUDENT sees a name list. | courses/[courseId]/roster/page.tsx | FR-17: extract the TEACHER/ADMIN table into a client component with Checkbox selection and a toolbar button \"Message selected students\". It opens the FR-12 dialog prefilled. Rows carry `enrollmentId`, so the student id needs to be included in `RosterEntry` if it is not already there. |\n| B16 | `NavItem` has no badge field. `NotificationBell` implements a visibility-gated 30 s poll + MUI `Badge`. | src/config/navigation.ts; NotificationBell.tsx L23-73 | FR-18: add `{label:'Messages', href:'/messages', roles: ALL_ROLES}` and an optional `badge?: 'messages'` key. The shell renders a polled Badge from `/api/messaging/unread-count`. Extract the bell's poll loop into a small `usePolling(fn, ms)` hook and reuse it for FR-13's 5 s/30 s polls. |\n| B17 | `/account/notifications` = page.tsx + `PreferencesTable.tsx`. `/api/me/*` routes exist (notification-preferences, profile, …). | src/app/(app)/account/notifications | FR-21: add a `QuietHoursSection` client component under that page, plus `src/app/api/me/messaging-settings/route.ts` (GET/PUT, any role). |\n| B18 | Seed users: Alice Admin, Tom Teacher, Tina Tutor, Sam Student, Sara Scholar and Pat Parent (by email). The seed creates **no ParentStudentLink** and no enrollments. Courses come from elsewhere and `findCourse(['MATH-7A'])` skips when missing. | prisma/seed.ts L16-22, L304 | FR-29: set `isSafeguardingLead=true` on Alice. The Pat↔Tom thread \"about Sam's homework\" needs a Pat↔Sam link to satisfy contact rules at runtime. Recommend the seed upsert that link (or skip the thread with a log, like other seeds). The MATH-7A group uses the first 4 ACTIVE enrollments and skips if there are fewer or the course is missing. Seeds write via Prisma directly (bypassing canMessage) but must leave data valid under canMessage. Make it idempotent by checking for existing seeded conversations (subject/participants). |\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-13\",\n  \"timestam